# Invariant 6: before proposing a Remove the instance checks that the target leaf is still present,
# and an action whose leaf is already gone is dropped rather than proposed. Bob is kicked and the
# Remove is committed; kicking him again names the same, now empty, leaf and is refused, and no
# freeze follows it: alice's next message goes straight through.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
group chat kind=text target=d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3 community=none creator=alice
join bob chat via=welcome
join carol chat via=welcome
sync carol
kick alice bob
commit alice
sync carol
expect_reject E_INVALID_REQUEST kick alice bob
send alice chat nothing is frozen
expect_decrypts carol chat nothing is frozen
